<title>UK: DEPFA unit sets $200 mln four-year bond.</title>
<headline>DEPFA unit sets $200 mln four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banque Nationale de Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEPFA FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR   DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    06.FEB.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.481   PAY DATE  L 05.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.856    SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> SALE LIMS  US/UK/DE/NL			  FORCE MAJ  IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
